00:55:47.150 --> 00:55:55.560
<v Ira Glass>Our senior producer is Julie Snyder. Production help from Tarek Fouda. Seth Lind is our operations director. Emily Condon's our office manager. Elise Bergerson's our administrative assistant.
<v Ira Glass>我们的资深制作人是 Julie Snyder。制作帮助来自 Tarek Fouda。Seth Lind 是我们的运营总监。Emily Condon 是我们的办公室经理。Elise Bergerson 是我们的行政助理。

00:55:55.560 --> 00:56:03.710
